Third-party notice for optimizers/tavo
======================================

The optimizer logic in this directory is a port of the TRUCE / TAVO trajectory-aware
verbalized prompt optimizer. The following prompt texts in driver.py are copied or
adapted from that MIT-licensed code (the public TRUCE release,
https://github.com/Bingo-W/TRUCE, commit 6428a6fc4dbca4f6e7fcebae493193c363accc8a,
which is built on MARBLE / MultiAgentBench):

  * the agent credit-assignment prompt (credit_assign), from
    marble/evaluator/agent_history_evaluator.py
    (AgentHistoryEvaluator.evaluate_agent_with_result_context);
  * the sub-trajectory (local iteration) evaluation prompt (_EQ3_PROMPT), from the
    local_iteration_evaluation template used by marble/evaluator/result_evaluator.py;
  * the salience ranking prompt (_get_most_salient_by_llm) and the per-agent
    refinement prompts (refine_agent_prompt, refine_with_meta_knowledge), from
    marble/evaluator/prompt_refiner.py (PromptRefiner);
  * the verbalized-policy overlay prompt and its TRUCE_VERBALIZED_POLICY /
    MARBLE_VERBALIZED_POLICY block markers (build_overlay_from_meta,
    strip_overlay_blocks, append_overlay), from truce/optimization/overlays.py
    (OverlayMixin).

The surrounding control flow (meta-suggestion merging, adoption gate, retry and
patience) follows the same release. The benchmark adaptations (dataset metric in place
of MARBLE's result evaluator, protocol budget ledger, source-tagged transcripts) are
not part of the upstream code. Those portions are used under the following license:

